# Accepted findings for the container image scan (#307).
#
# The image gate fails on CRITICAL vulnerabilities that have a fix available.
# A finding listed here is accepted and does not fail the gate. Policy:
# lucoenergia/conluz#474.
#
# One entry per line, in this format:
#
#   <ID> exp:<YYYY-MM-DD>  # <reason>
#
# - <ID> is the vulnerability ID Trivy reports (e.g. CVE-2024-12345).
# - exp: is mandatory. From that date on the entry no longer applies and the
#   finding blocks again, so an acceptance is reviewed instead of forgotten.
# - The reason after `#` is mandatory: why the finding is accepted, and what
#   would let us remove the entry.
#
# The workflows that scan the image lint this file and fail on an entry that
# lacks the expiry date or the reason.
